                </h6>
                <p class="texto-footer-adaptable opacity-75 mb-3 small">Asesoría inmobiliaria personalizada.</p>
                <a href="https://wa.me/573124504982" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-sm rounded-pill px-4 py-2" style="background: rgba(18, 140, 126, 0.15); border: 1px solid #128C7E; color: #25D366; transition: all 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.background='#128C7E'; this.style.color='#fff';" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(18, 140, 126, 0.15)'; this.style.color='#25D366';">
